+        A rival cash increase is the only behavioural signal used: it proves a
+        recent opponent sale (rather than assuming every mature farm dumps).  No
+        order is added unless (a) the rival currently exposes a material mature
+        volume, (b) that sale signal is recent, and (c) our route itself sells
+        the same item within 12 turns.  Unit actions, buys and route selection
+        are untouched.
+        """
+        prev_money = history.get("money")
